+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: original game-ready pixel-art four-direction character animation sprite atlas.
+Input image 1 is the authorized identity reference yakuza_ref01.png. Input image 2 is our original generated pixel portrait sheet of that same character. Use image 1 only for recognizable hair/face identity, image 2 for consistent character design and palette. Do not include photographic pixels, portrait busts, other people, or backgrounds.
+Make one precise game sprite sheet of the fictional Yakudza, short and VERY broad and overweight (120kg at170cm in fiction), huge round belly under a black crewneck T-shirt, thick neck, thick black asymmetric swept-up tousled hair, calm heavy-lidded dark eyes, clean-shaven round face; dark blue-grey trousers, dark shoes, phone in left hand. Original satirical design consistent with image2. Fictional body exaggeration, no real-person body inference.
+CRITICAL CAMERA: OVERHEAD TOP-DOWN ACTION GAME, looking steeply down at the top of his hair, shoulders and belly, with short FORESHORTENED legs visible below. NOT a side-view/platformer front-facing RPG paper doll. All directions share this exact overhead camera. Compact wide silhouette max40px wide and50px tall within a48x64 logical frame. Feet baseline logical y58. No floor shadows.
+Layout: exact 8 columns by4 rows, 32 frames, transparent canvas1536x1024. Each frame is192x256 pixels, representing a48x64 pixel drawing enlarged EXACTLY4x nearest neighbor. Each logical pixel is a perfectly crisp4x4 solid-color square. Center of each actor at horizontal logical x24, foot baseliney58. Keep ALL actors inside their own cell with8px logical side margins where possible and clear gutters. All frames same apparent scale.
+Rows top to bottom: 8 looking DOWN toward bottom of sheet; 8 looking LEFT; 8 looking RIGHT; 8 looking UP away from viewer (back of black hair and T-shirt, no face visible).
+Columns in EVERY row:0 calm idle standing,1 distinct idle breathing with belly/shoulders one pixel lower;2 walk left-foot forward,3 transition left-foot passing,4 centered planted left-foot,5 right-foot forward,6 transition right-foot passing,7 centered planted right-foot. Six clear small clumsy walking steps, anatomical limbs stay coherent, phone hand keeps phone with tiny sway. Left and right rows must genuinely point left/right. No duplicates of the neutral stance for every walk frame.
+TRUE low-resolution game pixel art: controlled shared palette maximum24 colors, near-black purple outlines and hair, black tee with subtle violet highlights,5 warm tan skin tones, desaturated charcoal-blue trousers, tiny cyan phone light. Solid cluster shading and hard staircase edges only. Do not render 3D, photorealism, painterly textures, antialiasing, blur, smooth gradients, huge detailed illustration, gridlines, labels, text, UI, watermarks, logos, weapons, hats, additional props or backgrounds. Each of32 frames is an actual full-body sprite, not a poster or a portrait collage.
